# Build output
/build/

# Stdlib + deps. `lib/` is resolved from cyrius.cyml `[deps]`: `cyrius
# build`/`test` auto-vendor the stdlib here from the version-pinned
# ~/.cyrius/versions/<v>/lib/ snapshot (CI symlinks it instead). A build
# artifact, not source — never commit. Pre-1.2.0 nous committed lib/*.cyr,
# which shadowed the version-matched 6.0.1 stdlib; de-vendored at 1.2.0.
# No trailing slash: matches both the vendored dir and the CI symlink.
/lib

# NOTE: dist/ is deliberately tracked. dist/nous.cyr is nous's
# consumer-facing bundle (`cyrius distlib`), not a transient artifact.

